    obo:IAO_0000115 "OBSOLETE. A colour quality recognized according to Ridgway's 1912 standard by closest match to Salmon Color chip XIV 9-prime-d; Hamly gives the approximate legacy conversion Munsell 5YR 7.5/6.0."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Obsoleted by the ISCC-NBS colour backbone (curator decision 2026-09-18): FLOPO keeps only ISCC-NBS level-1 to level-3 colour classes, and colour words become botanical_colour_name synonyms. Consider 'pink' (FLOPO:0988000); the former label is now a synonym of that class."@en,
        "Use only when Ridgway 1912 or the named chip is specified. FLOPO-local source-qualified colour quality; its generic colour is PATO:0104326 (salmon colour). The physical chip remains normative."@en ;
    dcterms:contributor <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8149-5890> ;
