    obo:IAO_0000116 "Curator decision D1 (Robert Hoehndorf, 2026-09-18): mint FLOPO EQ phenotype classes for the NCVC Saudi guide's PO x PATO candidates through the reviewed-combination path. Pair PO:0030121 x PATO:0000324 approved in curation/curator-2026-09-18-po-pato-approvals.tsv; attested by 6 assertion(s) for 6 taxon/taxa in ncvc-saudi-native-plants-guide-2024 (PDF pages 64, 152, 157, 162, 163, 271)."@en ;
